OL,3,ACarney courts foreign money pitching
OL,4,ACanada as 'safe harbour' at investment
OL,5,Asummit
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister has pledged to bring
OL,8,Fin C$1tn in investments in the b@Lnext
OL,9,FbA five years as he seeks to reduce
OL,10,FCanada's reliance on the US, and the
OL,11,Fsummit he convened this week is a test
OL,12,Fof whether he can deliver on promises
OL,13,Fto strengthen economic resilience.
OL,15,FThe stakes are high as the trade
OL,16,Fdispute with the US has pushed Canada
OL,17,Fto seek deeper economic partnerships
OL,18,Fwith Europe, Asia and the Middle East.
